WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Piston
What it does: Receives gas pressure and transmits its force through the pin to the connecting rod.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Piston
How it works: Combustion pushes the crown down.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Piston
How it moves: Travels 95 mm between its extremes. Pistons 1 and 4 share the same height; 2 and 3 move oppositely.
